==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 62% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 61% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spawn meatshields to stall them. Then fire the [[Cat Cannon]] and spawn [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. Don't let your cats progress to the enemy base just yet. When Jackie Peng appears, your Worker Cat should be at max level. Spawn [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and a few [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] along with meatshields and Axe Cats.

