==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Wakayama Prefecture'''.
*Ghana is among the world's largest exporters of cocoa beans, hence why its base is a chocolate bar.
*Wakayama Prefecture's base is a barrel of [[wikipedia:Umeboshi|umeboshi]], a pickled [[wikipedia:Prunus mume|''ume'']] fruit (commonly called a "Japanese plum" or "Japanese apricot" in English). Wakayama Prefecture produces almost 70% of Japan's ume and umeboshi.

